Error [E0123]: A source loop stride must be Int (a whole number), not String (text)
  --> tests/ui/source_stride_wrong_type.jet:2:29
    |
  2 |     loop item in [1, 2, 3], "two" -> print(item)
    |                             ^^^^^
 Why: The stride counts source pulls, so it must be a positive whole number
 Fix: Use an Int stride of 1 or more
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0123
